```plaintext
Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```

```turtle
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/ns#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

ex:Scene1 a ex:DrivingScene ;
    ex:hasWeatherCondition ex:Rainy ;
    ex:hasLightCondition ex:Night .

ex:Rainy a ex:WeatherCondition ;
    rdfs:label "Rainy" .

ex:Night a ex:LightCondition ;
    rdfs:label "Night" .

ex:Vehicle1 a ex:Vehicle ;
    ex:hasColor "Yellow" ;
    ex:hasPosition ex:FrontPosition ;
    ex:hasSpeed "Moderate" ;
    ex:hasVehicleType ex:Car ;
    ex:isFollowing ex:Vehicle2 .

ex:Vehicle2 a ex:Vehicle ;
    ex:hasColor "Red" ;
    ex:hasPosition ex:CurrentPosition ;
    ex:hasSpeed "Slow" ;
    ex:hasVehicleType ex:Car .

ex:Road a ex:RoadInfrastructure ;
    ex:hasSurfaceCondition ex:Wet ;
    ex:hasLaneMarkings ex:DoubleYellowLines ;
    ex:hasTrafficSigns ex:NoneVisible .

ex:DoubleYellowLines a ex:LaneMarking ;
    rdfs:label "Double Yellow Lines" .

ex:Wet a ex:SurfaceCondition ;
    rdfs:label "Wet" .

ex:Building1 a ex:Building ;
    ex:hasPosition ex:RightSide .

ex:StreetLight1 a ex:StreetLight ;
    ex:hasPosition ex:MultiplePositions ;
    ex:hasLightCondition ex:On .

ex:Pedestrian1 a ex:Pedestrian ;
    ex:hasVisibility ex:Low ;
    ex:hasPosition ex:FarRight .

ex:Obstacle1 a ex:Obstacle ;
    ex:hasType ex:Debris ;
    ex:hasPosition ex:ScatteredOnRoad .

ex:Vehicle1 ex:isApproaching ex:Intersection .
ex:Vehicle1 ex:isOccludedBy ex:Debris .
ex:Vehicle2 ex:isFollowing ex:Vehicle1 .
ex:Vehicle2 ex:hasFrontPosition ex:CurrentPosition .
ex:Vehicle1 ex:hasFrontPosition ex:FrontPosition .
ex:Vehicle1 ex:hasReflection ex:HeadlightReflectionOnWetSurface .
```

---

**Identified Risks for each risk class:**

**Risk 1:**
Description: Reduced visibility due to rain and nighttime conditions, increasing the risk of misidentifying obstacles or other vehicles.
Severity Score: 0.85

**Risk 2:**
Description: Wet road surface leading to decreased traction and increased risk of skidding or hydroplaning.
Severity Score: 0.80

**Risk 3:**
Description: Potential for headlight glare and reflections on wet surfaces, obscuring the view of other vehicles and pedestrians.
Severity Score: 0.75

**Risk 4:**
Description: Presence of scattered debris on the road, posing a risk of vehicle damage or loss of control.
Severity Score: 0.70

**Risk 5:**
Description: Low visibility of pedestrians due to darkness and rain, increasing the risk of pedestrian-vehicle collisions.
Severity Score: 0.80

**Risk 6:**
Description: Following too closely (tailgating) by Vehicle2, reducing the reaction time for Vehicle1 in case of sudden braking.
Severity Score: 0.75

**Risk 7:**
Description: Potential for misjudging distances and speeds due to the combined effects of rain and nighttime, leading to unsafe driving maneuvers.
Severity Score: 0.85

